    'home.about.tag':         'About',
    'home.about.title':       'I don\'t have all<br>the answers.',
    'home.about.body1':       'I\'m a curious woman, entrepreneur, mom, and computer science student. Since the pandemic, I\'ve saved $200,000 by living below my means and investing consistently.',
    'home.about.body2':       'This blog is my <strong>financial lab</strong> — my ideas, my mistakes, my wins. Not perfect advice. A human journey.',
