    'eco.highlight2':         ' <strong>Key note:</strong> For construction trades (electrical, plumbing, etc.), a <strong>RBQ license</strong> is mandatory to operate a business in Quebec. For finance, the <strong>Autorité des marchés financiers (AMF)</strong> exam is required. Research before you start.',
    'eco.h2.message':         'The real message',
    'eco.p5':                 'I\'m not saying it\'s easy. But I\'ve always believed that nobody is coming to save us — and that <strong>it\'s precisely that reality that pushes us to find creative solutions</strong>.',
    'eco.p6':                 'A side hustle can start small and become your main source of income. That happened to me. And sometimes, working on your own project — even modestly — gives a quality of life and freedom that no employer can offer.',
    'eco.disclaimer':         ' Informational content only. Training information is indicative — check with the relevant institutions for specific details and requirements.',
